sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant CAM as Camera
  participant DET as Detection Service
  participant POL as Traffic Police
  participant SYS as Backend System
  participant DB as Database
  participant NOTI as Notification Service
  participant DR as Driver

  CAM->>DET: Capture vehicle event image/video
  DET->>DET: Detect possible violation
  DET->>POL: Send evidence for validation
  POL->>SYS: Confirm violation

  SYS->>DB: Create violation record
  SYS->>SYS: Calculate fine amount
  SYS->>DB: Store fine and due date

  SYS->>NOTI: Trigger violation notification
  NOTI->>DR: Send SMS/Email/App notice

  DR->>SYS: Open notice and view fine
  SYS->>DB: Fetch violation details
  SYS-->>DR: Show ticket and payment link
